  "title": "Vertiv Expands its Portfolio of Infrastructure Solutions Wholesalers in México",
  "summary": "Vertiv announced its new partnership with Luguer, a Mexican multi-brand wholesaler whose value-added services span more than 20 years of experience in the market, over which time it has become one of the main distributors of telecommunications infrastructure. With 11 branches across Mexico, Luguer will offer its clients the complete portfolio of solutions from Vertiv, including those for cooling and energy for data centers and telecommunications networks.",
